, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/a8/c4/56/844db72449e3ee1fb994bdab7a9f0725.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/a8/c4/56/844db72449e3ee1fb994bdab7a9f0725.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/a8/c4/56/844db72449e3ee1fb994bdab7a9f0725.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a8/c4/56/844db72449e3ee1fb994bdab7a9f0725.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/a8/c4/56/844db72449e3ee1fb994bdab7a9f0725.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/bd/25/ee/d91a108f8ac2fd2566357f85df9353a4.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/bd/25/ee/d91a108f8ac2fd2566357f85df9353a4.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/bd/25/ee/d91a108f8ac2fd2566357f85df9353a4.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/bd/25/ee/d91a108f8ac2fd2566357f85df9353a4.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/bd/25/ee/d91a108f8ac2fd2566357f85df9353a4.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/86/1c/ab/d2b032d038533814c3312629c566c652.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/86/1c/ab/d2b032d038533814c3312629c566c652.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/86/1c/ab/d2b032d038533814c3312629c566c652.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/86/1c/ab/d2b032d038533814c3312629c566c652.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/86/1c/ab/d2b032d038533814c3312629c566c652.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/20/c8/b8/cc8fbd0a941bacaa2a0504a5ade70f61.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"http